{
  "bookId": "hero-213207",
  "id": "bond-43815",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43815001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "在找什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一个全新的手办屋，昨天晚上就放在这里。那是送给你的礼物……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "哦，你说那个呀——不就在你眼前吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "我看到上面写的自己的名字，就忍不住做了些小改装。你喜欢吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "工作台上摆着一个全然陌生的手办屋，看起来像是……彩虹被打翻在了上面。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "的确，如果仔细查看的话——至少在建筑结构方面，依稀还能找到之前的影子。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43815008",
              "text": "挺不错的。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43815008",
              "text": "很有你的风格。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43815007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "哼，说得也太敷衍了，其实只是客套话吧。过来，看着我的眼睛告诉我——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "如果让你和我一起住在这样的房子里，你愿意吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43815011",
              "text": "这又不可能。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43815011",
              "text": "我住不进去的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43815010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "还记得我说过的吗？只要想做，总会有办法。我可以改变世界~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43815013",
              "text": "你……打算做什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43815012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "别管那么多，先回答我的问题。是愿意呢，还是，愿意呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43815015",
              "text": "愿意的吧。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43815015",
              "text": "这不是根本没得选吗。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43815014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "好耶！那么恭喜你，心愿要成真了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43815017",
              "text": "什么意思？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43815016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43815017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "一个晚上很长，我可不止改装了这一个地方哦~现在，打开你的卧室门，迎接惊喜吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
